OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMusic written in PoW camp in WW2
OL,4,Afinally performed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA piece of orchestral music written
OL,7,Finside a prisoner of war camp during
OL,8,FWorld War Two has been performed for
OL,9,Fthe first time.
OL,11,FAlan Bolt, who lived near Barrow for
OL,12,Fdecades before his death in 2019 at age
OL,13,F100, wrote the concerto at a German PoW
OL,14,Fcamp near the end of the war in
OL,15,Fcelebration of the anticipated Allied
OL,16,Fvictory.
OL,18,FHis widow Alison Bolt said the piece -
OL,19,FOverture for a Festival - was never
OL,20,Fperformed because the camp was
OL,21,Fliberated soon after by Russian
OL,22,Fsoldiers.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
