OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMusic written in PoW camp in WW2
OL,4,Afinally performed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe composition was finally performed
OL,7,Fby the Liverpool Philharmonic in Barrow
OL,8,FTown Hall on Friday and his widow said
OL,9,Fhe would have been "absolutely over the
OL,10,Fmoon".
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
